{
    "title": "Prank Sounds & Haircut, Fart",
    "description": "<b>Prank Sounds & Fart, Haircut</b> is the perfect app to turn any moment into a hilarious prank. Whether at a party, in the office, or just having fun, this app guarantees side-splitting laughter. With a variety of sounds, from airhorns to surprises, you can customize your pranks like never before! Download <b>Prank Sounds & Fart, Haircut</b> now and become the life of the party, the office jester, and the ultimate prank master. Take your pranking skills to the next level today!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49 MAIN FEATURES OF PRANK SOUNDS - PRANK APP/FUNNY SOUNDS:\r\n- 500+ Realistic Prank Sound Choices\r\n- Diverse Sound Lengths and Memes\r\n- High-quality, loud, crystal-clear prank sound effects\r\n- Best Car, Farts and Scary Sounds.\r\n- Extensive Prank Collection\r\n- Record & Custom Funny Prank Sounds Creation\r\n- Top HOT Prank Sound\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcdd List prank sounds for the app Funny Prank Sound - Fart Sound:\r\n- Air Horn Sound\r\n- Fart Sounds\r\n- Hair Clipper/Dryer\r\n- Baby Sneeze\r\n- Breaking\r\n- Burp\r\n- Car Sound\r\n- Door Bell\r\n- Gun/Stun Gun\r\n- Laughing & Clapping\r\n- Man/Woman Cough\r\n- Man/Woman Sneeze\r\n- Police\r\n- Siren Head\r\n- Scary\r\n- Toilet Flushing\r\n- Fart Song\r\n- Scissors\r\n- Animal Sound\r\n- Business & Office\r\n- Doors\r\n- Tools\r\n- Blowing Nose\r\n- Boom\r\n- Clocking\r\n- Meme Sounds\r\n\r\n\u2702 Haircut Prank & Fake Hair Clippers Prank:\r\nThis fake razor prank delivers a realistic experience with authentic clipper sounds and vibrations. The sound changes as you move it over your target\u2019s head, making it feel like a real haircut. Your friends will truly believe their hair is being shaved!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udce2 Air Horn Prank & Air Horn Sounds:\r\nSurprise your friends and family with powerful, realistic air horn sounds. Whether it\u2019s the roar of a train, the blast of a ship, a truck\u2019s rumble, or the blare of a car horn, this app offers a wide range of authentic air horn effects to amaze and trick everyone.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca8 Fart Sounds & Fart Prank:\r\nTurn your phone into a fart sound machine and prank your friends with hilarious fart noises. Use the fart noise timer or create your own fart symphonies for endless laughter.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc7b Ghost Sounds & Prank Ghost Scare:\r\nSet the mood for a spooky Halloween or scare your friends at a sleepover with a collection of eerie ghost sounds, whispers, and screams. This app lets you send chills down anyone\u2019s spine with its terrifying sound effects.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0a\ud83d\udd0aEasily transform your phone into a fake hair clipper, air horn, or fart machine for hilarious pranks with friends. Enjoy a variety of prank sounds like glass breaking, car horns, and fart symphonies. Watch your buddies panic with the fart timer or surprise them with a realistic haircut prank!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udeab Safety Reminder:\r\nKeep in mind, pranks should be all about fun. Always prioritize harmlessness and thoughtfulness when planning your pranks. Refrain from using the app in situations where it might be inappropriate or hurtful, and be respectful of others' feelings.\r\n\r\n<b>Download Funny Prank Sound - Fart Sound & Air Horn Prank</b> now to add an extra dose of humour and joy to your life with our sound prank\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25\r\n-------------\r\nRate 5\u2b50 to support our developer team!\r\nEnjoy \u2764\ufe0f",
